 expression in primary human cancer with microsatellite instability</article-title><source>Oncogene</source><year>2004</year><volume>23</volume><fpage>2640</fpage><lpage>2647</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Oncogene||23|2640||bib11|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15048091</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Giannini</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Ristori</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Cerignoli</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Rinaldi</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Zani</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Viel</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Ottini</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Crescenzi</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Martinotti</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Bignami</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Frati</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Screpanti</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Gulino</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Human MRE11 is inactivated in mismatch repair-deficient cancers</article-title><source>EMBO Rep</source><year>2002</year><volume>3</volume><fpage>248</fpage><lpage>254</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'EMBO Rep||3|248||bib12|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11850399</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Giardiello</surname><given-names>FM</given-names></name><name><surname>Brensinger</surname><given-names>JD</given-names></name><name><surname>Petersen</surname><given-names>GM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>AGA technical review on hereditary colorectal cancer and genetic testing</article-tit